     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Cheng-Yi,<div><br></div><div>本例可使用 apply 函數, 須使用3個參數, 其中第2個參數, 1:表示以列為基準, 2:表示以行為基準, 配合 na.rm=TRUE 即可完成.</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-6oKei6rcN8M/WKfivJ6klzI/AAAAAAAALLQ/Hd4T0J4hgss9y9JEMhZlfWN-4loRoYkRgCLcB/s1600/%25E5%25BB%25BA%25E7%25AB%258B%25E6%2596%25B0%25E6%25AC%2584%25E4%25BD%258D.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-6oKei6rcN8M/WKfivJ6klzI/AAAAAAAALLQ/Hd4T0J4hgss9y9JEMhZlfWN-4loRoYkRgCLcB/s1600/%2525E5%2525BB%2525BA%2525E7%2525AB%25258B%2525E6%252596%2525B0%2525E6%2525AC%252584%2525E4%2525BD%25258D.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237786381000&amp;usg=AOvVaw14HEaneOgL2JyyUlSSYMw9\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-6oKei6rcN8M/WKfivJ6klzI/AAAAAAAALLQ/Hd4T0J4hgss9y9JEMhZlfWN-4loRoYkRgCLcB/s400/%25E5%25BB%25BA%25E7%25AB%258B%25E6%2596%25B0%25E6%25AC%2584%25E4%25BD%258D.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"122\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div># title: 建立新欄位</div><div># date: 2017.2.18</div><div>x &lt;- data.frame(x1=c(1, 4, 7), x2=c(2, 5, NA), x3=c(3, NA, 9))</div><div>x$x4 &lt;- apply(x, 1, mean, na.rm=TRUE)</div><div>x</div></div></code></div><br><br><br>林承萓於 2017年2月18日星期六 UTC+8上午8時33分38秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">想請問有一個dataset 有三個血壓值<div>我要產生一個新欄位為他們的平均</div><div>但因為有些欄位第三次血壓值為NA</div><div>所以要定義如果第三次為NA，就以前兩次的血壓為平均</div><div>第三次不是NA，則用三次的平均</div><div>這樣該怎麼寫?</div><div>這需要用到迴圈嗎?</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
